 "remarks": "Some homes are simply unforgettable. Set high above the street on 1.19 lush acres in coveted Old Hill, this extraordinary new residence blends striking architecture and sophisticated design. A gracious front porch overlooks a courtyard-like driveway. Created by Sam Development LLC.,CMS Architects, and Interior Designer Mary Beth Woods, this distinctive home offers approximately 6,000 SF across four levels, with 5 bedrooms, 5 baths, 2 half baths, 9' ceilings on the first and second floors, 6\" white oak flooring, and exceptional details. The spectacular kitchen features high-end appliances, oversized island and walk-in pantry, opening to the family room with gas fireplace and breakfast area. Glass sliders lead to a granite patio and landscaped grounds. An elegant dining room with built-in buffet and bar and a glass doored living room/study complete the main level. The vaulted, beamed primary suite features a spa-like bath and two walk-in closets. Three additional bedrooms, spacious laundry, finished third- floor space with half bath, and a lower level with family room, bedroom,full bath, gym, and storage offer versatility. The detached 1,050 SF ADU is ideal for in-laws, guests, office/studio, or future pool house. Three-car garage with bonus room, spray-foam insulation, approximately 100 recessed lights. 22-KW Generac generator, 400-amp electrical services, and EV outlet. Come experience this exceptional Old Hill property and discover a home that stands apart.",
